<title>USA: Kopp group holds 12.7 pct Zygo Corp stake.</title>
<headline>Kopp group holds 12.7 pct Zygo Corp stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Kopp Investment Advisors Inc said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Monday it holds a 12.7 percent stake in Zygo Corp or 610,356 common shares.</p>
<p>The group disclosed its latest position on Zygo in a 13G filing.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company.  Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
